## 四、项目配置

### 1. 后端配置

#### application.yml 说明

```yaml
server:
  port: 8080  # 后端端口，可修改

spring:
  datasource:
    # H2 内存数据库（开发环境）
    url: jdbc:h2:mem:submission_db;DB_CLOSE_DELAY=-1
    driver-class-name: org.h2.Driver
    username: sa
    password:
  
  # 生产环境切换为 MySQL
  # url: jdbc:mysql://localhost:3306/submission_db?useSSL=false&serverTimezone=UTC
  # driver-class-name: com.mysql.cj.jdbc.Driver
  # username: root
  # password: your_password

jwt:
  secret: your-secret-key-here  # 生产环境必须修改！
  expiration: 604800000        # 7天（毫秒）

file:
  upload-path: ./uploads/       # 文件上传路径
```

#### 修改 JWT 密钥（生产环境）

```bash
# Linux/macOS
export JWT_SECRET=$(openssl rand -base64 32)

# Windows PowerShell
$env:JWT_SECRET = -join ((48..57) + (65..90) + (97..122) | Get-Random -Count 32 | ForEach-Object {[char]$_})
```

